<title>JAPAN: Tokai Bk has 29.2 bln yen in loans to Tokai Kogyo.</title>
<headline>Tokai Bk has 29.2 bln yen in loans to Tokai Kogyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokai Bank Ltd said on Monday that it had 29.2 billion yen worth of loans to failed construction firm Tokai Kogyo Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It also said that while it planned to write off problem loans in the first half of 1997/98 to September 30, it did not expect to see a big change in its earnings estimates.</p>
</text>
